I left out the two operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no filesystem or HTTP authority. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or calling the metadata service would need capabilities this node doesn't have, and adding them would widen its authority. If operations still needs those, they belong in a node whose `with` clause grants the matching interfaces.

